description: >
  Professional toolpath generation and postprocessing for large-format additive manufacturing and CNC systems.
  
  Designed for Weber Additive 3D printing systems, LARGERslicer provides complete workflow automation from geometry to machine-ready code. Features include:
  
  • DXR Robot Codes: Generate .DXR files for robot control systems (KUKA robots)
  • DXR Postprocessor: Convert GCode to .DXR format automatically
  • Direct DXR Generator: Create .DXR files directly from toolpaths
  • Zünd CNC Fräse: Generate .HPGL code for Zünd flatbed cutters (3-axis simultaneous control)
  • Advanced Toolpath Tools: Continuous path generation, infill patterns, and optimization
  • Automation Tools: Helper components for workflow automation
  
  Example files and documentation for FH Münster / MSA (Münster School of Architecture) systems available on GitHub.
url: https://github.com/Moeewe/LARGER.slicer
